{"product_id":"monster-bugs-step-into-reading-step-3","title":"Monster Bugs (Step-Into-Reading, Step 3)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBest-selling simplifier of science Lucille Recht Penner unearths the truth about the water bug which sucks its victims' blood like a vampire, the assassin bug which turns its prey to mush with a special poison, and other barbaric bugs. This vividly illustrated collection of sensational but true bug facts is sure to set young readers' skin crawling!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Lucille Recht Penner\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780679869740\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738268426393,"sku":"5RD9780679869740","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68cf943c48443_Monster_Bugs__Step-Into-Reading__Step_3__Lucille_Recht_Penner.jpg?v=1758560169","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/monster-bugs-step-into-reading-step-3","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}